A '''Snoozle''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Snoozles''' have a {{Chance|50%|1|2}} chance to spawn from behind any of the {{Green|5}} walls in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}. In order to reach them, the player must run into walls made of {{Item|Cobbled Deepslate|link=}} and {{Item|Tuff|link=}} {{Green|3}} times.

== Behavior ==
'''Snoozles''' sit still. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Snoozle''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

